%!PS-Adobe-3.0
%%BoundingBox: 0 0 320 200
%%Title: Alpine forest
% Status: draft
% fractal_clouds#1: a conifer forest on the valley floor and lower slopes
% under the ridged-fBm massif of gallery/mountains.ps, seen from the
% valley's edge; one ray per pixel. Preview: DPI=36 scripts/render.sh.
% Large: DPI=288 scripts/render.sh -D ErN=1024 -D ErDrops=240000 (1280x800,
% about an hour; scripts/render_bands.sh splits it across cores).
% Closer look at part of a large frame: -D "Crop=[0.3 0.6 0.5 0.8]".

/Seed where { pop } { /Seed 5 def } ifelse
/AA where { pop } { /AA true def } ifelse          % antialias depth edges (before fc_render.ps loads)
/GroundOn where { pop } { /GroundOn true def } ifelse   % rocks, rough ground and grass close up (#29)
/Pitch where { pop } { /Pitch 3 def } ifelse
/Yaw where { pop } { /Yaw -27 def } ifelse         % toward the massif
/SunDir where { pop } { /SunDir [ 0.55 0.50 0.45 ] def } ifelse    % from the right, a little ahead
/CloudLo where { pop } { /CloudLo 60 def /CloudHi 88 def } ifelse
/CoverAmp where { pop } { /CoverAmp 0.45 def } ifelse      % clouds in groups
/HazeDist where { pop } { /HazeDist 650 def } ifelse      % some depth, though the camera is low in denser air
/Threshold where { pop } { /Threshold 0.57 def } ifelse
/TerrOX where { pop } { /TerrOX 180 def /TerrOZ 400 def } ifelse   % stand at the edge of a valley floor
/HFov where { pop } { /HFov 50 def } ifelse
/TreesOn where { pop } { /TreesOn true def } ifelse   % the forest (lib/fc_trees.ps)
/CamAbove where { pop } { /CamAbove 8 def } ifelse  % camera height above the ground below it
/SnowLine where { pop } { /SnowLine 27 def } ifelse  % early summer

(lib/fc_landscape.ps) run
320 200 fc-landscape
showpage
